  <div class="problem-block">
    <p>记$\triangle ABC$的内角$A$、$B$、$C$的对边分别为$a,b,c$，已知</p>
    <p style="text-align:center;">$$\dfrac{\cos A}{1+\sin A}=\dfrac{\sin 2B}{1+\cos 2B}$$</p>
    <p class="indent">(1) 若$C=\dfrac{2\pi}{3}$，求$B$；</p>
    <p class="indent">(2) 求$\dfrac{a^2+b^2}{c^2}$的最小值。</p>

    <div class="solution">
      <span class="solution-tag">【解析】</span>
      <p style="text-align:center; margin-top:4px;">
        $$\dfrac{\sin 2B}{1+\cos 2B}=\dfrac{2\sin B\cos B}{2\cos^2 B}=\dfrac{\sin B}{\cos B}=\dfrac{\cos A}{1+\sin A}$$
      </p>
      <p>$\Rightarrow \sin B+\sin B\sin A=\cos B\cos A$</p>
      <p>$\Rightarrow \sin B=\cos B\cos A-\sin B\sin A=-\cos(B+A)=-\cos C$</p>
      <p>$\because B,C\in(0,\pi)$，$\therefore \sin B>0 \Rightarrow \cos C<0$，$C>\dfrac{\pi}{2}$，$B\in\left(0,\dfrac{\pi}{2}\right)$</p>
      <p>$\sin B=\sin\left(C-\dfrac{\pi}{2}\right) \Rightarrow B=C-\dfrac{\pi}{2}$ 或 $B+C-\dfrac{\pi}{2}=\pi$（舍）</p>
      <p>(1) $B=\dfrac{\pi}{2}-\dfrac{\pi}{3}=\dfrac{\pi}{6}$</p>
      <p>(2) 因为我们有角的关系，我们把边化为角：$A=\pi-B-C=\pi-2B$；$C=\dfrac{\pi}{2}+B$</p>
      <p>由正弦定理：</p>
      <p style="text-align:center;">
        $$\dfrac{a^2+b^2}{c^2}=\dfrac{\sin^2A+\sin^2B}{\sin^2C}=\dfrac{\cos^22B+\sin^2B}{\cos^22B}=\dfrac{(2\cos^2B-1)^2+1-\cos^2B}{\cos^22B}$$
      </p>
      <p>令 $x=\cos^2B$，$x\in(0,1)$</p>
      <p style="text-align:center;">
        $$\dfrac{a^2+b^2}{c^2}=\dfrac{(2x-1)^2+1-x}{x}=\dfrac{4x^2-5x+2}{x}=4x+\dfrac{2}{x}-5\geq 2\sqrt{8}-5=4\sqrt2-5$$
      </p>
      <p>$4x=2\sqrt2 \Rightarrow x=\dfrac{\sqrt2}{2}$ 时取等号</p>
    </div>
  </div>

