    <p>如图，直三棱柱$ABC{-}A_1B_1C_1$的体积为4，$\triangle A_1BC$的面积为$2\sqrt2$.</p>
    <p class="indent">(1) 求$A$到平面$A_1BC$的距离；</p>
    <p class="indent">(2) 设$D$为$A_1C$的中点，$AA_1=AB$，平面$A_1BC\perp$平面$ABB_1A_1$，求二面角$A{-}BD{-}C$的正弦值。</p>

    <div class="solution">
      <span class="solution-tag">【解析】</span>
      <p>(1)等体积法：设$A$到平面$A_1BC$的距离为$h$</p>
      <p style="text-align:center;">
        $$V_{A_1{-}ABC}=V_{A{-}A_1BC} \Rightarrow \dfrac{1}{3}\times4=\dfrac{1}{3}S_{\triangle A_1BC}\cdot h \Rightarrow h=\sqrt2$$
      </p>

      <div class="placeholder diagram2">[Diagram: 立体图，含点D、M、N及辅助线，右下方]</div>

